MONUMENT = (A ∩ base) ∪ (B ∩ centerpiece) ∪ (C ∩ sequence) ∪ (D ∩ maps) ∪ (E ∩ errors) ∪ (F ∩ notes) ∪ (G ∩ nature) ∪ (H ∩ text) 
