Use a realistic portrait or fashion/product subject, one dominant transparent structure, strong typography, and meaningful brand information.

The transparent material must have real thickness, edges, reflections, refraction, and believable spatial depth. Its geometry should control the composition, including portrait placement, product position, typography alignment, light direction, and negative space.

