Use one oversized headline, clear brand information, a secondary product title, and a small amount of meaningful campaign copy. Avoid fake barcodes, badges, random numbers, meaningless filler text, fake UI, and decorative clutter.

The final image should feel like a real high-end fashion, jewelry, skincare, eyewear, or product campaign with strong thumbnail impact, mature editorial density, and a clear optical concept.

